Type: Package
Package: rdkitpyr
Title: Task-Oriented Cheminformatics in R Using the RDKit Python Interface
Version: 0.1.0.9006
Authors@R: person("Andrey", "Samokhin",
                  email = "andrey.s.samokhin@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0223-6087"))
Description: A task-oriented R interface to the RDKit Python library via
    'reticulate'. The package provides high-level cheminformatics
    functionality, including molecule parsing, descriptor calculation, and
    fingerprint generation without mirroring RDKit's native API structure.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://mass-spec.ru/projects/cheminformatics/rdkitpyr/eng/
BugReports: https://github.com/AndreySamokhin/rdkitpyr/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    reticulate,
    utils
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Python, NumPy, RDKit (Python)
Encoding: UTF-8
